  "scope": "A constructive replay screen at one decision, using the original PRNG seed and recorded semantic actions. Accepted cases preserve all 33 public logs, observers and own legal-action boundaries and pass native team validation. A failed seeded replay does not exclude a different chance history with the same observations. Item conflicts are tested by swapping the previous holder to the original berry. EV and DV sweeps vary one independent stat at a time; happiness uses six values. These are not a complete hidden-state information set or a population sample. The solved comparison family contains the prior 39 moves, an empty fourth slot, and only three additional Double Edge worlds with Gold Berry, Bright Powder or Focus Band. It is not the full product of 55 items and 40 move candidates; alternative stats are not included in its value matrix. The lower strategy mixes the two first moves before observing the simultaneous opposing move, then uses one common Rock Slide priority. Lower bounds allow an even stronger adversary to react to the first draw. The dual upper certificate randomizes the two hidden item worlds before the player acts and uses a fixed Sleep Talk/Sleep Talk/Hidden Power Ice schedule independent of the player draw. Future own play is granted full-state optimality for that upper bound. Existing engine transitions and guarded-key contracts remain trusted. Rational matrix calculations use the outward-padded ledgers, with an additional 1e-8 margin. No claim of deployed-bot improvement, online runtime, human calibration or full-game optimum."
